0944c5ef509","decision":"DEFER","disposition":"Caller-supplied dynamic-int8 wav2vec2-base rate-encoder readiness blocker; no implementation, adapter, asset or result.","exact_blockers":[{"artifact_id":"ART-02","id":"BLK-01","linked_gates":["RG-01","RG-02"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Supply the immutable upstream snapshot at revision 22aad52d435eb6dbaf354bdad9b0da84ce7d6156 with every file's byte count and SHA-256, the reviewed model card and license/notice bundle, and a redistribution/product-use decision.","statement":"The exact facebook/wav2vec2-base-960h weight snapshot is absent. The research source record pins model.safetensors at 377,607,901 bytes and SHA-256 8aa76ab2..., but no local file exists at the runner's HF_HOME, data/checkouts, data/models or the Hugging Face cache. The smallest verifiable model reference cannot be built from metadata alone, and no weight was downloaded or reconstructed.","status":"open"},{"artifact_id":"ART-03","id":"BLK-02","linked_gates":["RG-02","RG-03"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Either supply a serialized QNNPACK dynamic-int8 state dict with SHA-256/byte count, or reproduce the exact FP32 snapshot plus the pinned quantization recipe in the locked runtime and pin the resulting artifact and quantized parameter inventory.","statement":"No quantized encoder artifact is present. The historical pilot quantized in memory with QNNPACK and saved only mean-pooled embeddings; int8_embeddings.npz is a derived feature archive, not a quantized state dict. The recipe source is pinned, but its output bytes and runtime behavior are not.","status":"open"},{"artifact_id":"ART-04","id":"BLK-03","linked_gates":["RG-03"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Supply a locked offline environment with exact Python/torch/transformers versions, wheel hashes, install/import digest, QNNPACK engine selection, deterministic settings and one intra-op/one inter-op thread, then record a clean-room import and load.","statement":"No pinned runtime is present. Python 3.10.13 with torch 2.2.2, transformers 4.40.2 and QNNPACK is required, but the pinned CPython 3.12.16 and the available 3.11.5 interpreters expose no torch or transformers, and the historical data/envs/sylnet-py310 environment is absent. No import, quantization or inference was attempted.","status":"open"},{"artifact_id":"ART-05","id":"BLK-04","linked_gates":["RG-04","RG-06"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Freeze a permitted, speaker/meeting-disjoint rate cohort with reviewed AMI/corpus and CMUdict terms, independently checked syllable labels, language/speaker groups and source-timestamp provenance.","statement":"The historical cohort is one AMI EN2003a meeting (210 four-second windows), not a rights-cleared multi-meeting rate corpus. Reference syllables come from AMI orthographic transcripts plus CMUdict first pronunciations, not human syllable-nucleus labels. AMI audio/annotation and CMUdict terms have not been reviewed here, and no audio byte was read for this package.","status":"open"},{"artifact_id":"ART-06","id":"BLK-05","linked_gates":["RG-05","RG-06"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Run the paired FP32 and dynamic-int8 paths on the qualified cohort with a frozen scorer, exact folds, nonfinite/output checks, identity and constant baselines, and adverse/missing controls.","statement":"No FP32/int8 accuracy, embedding-fidelity or finite-output comparison was reproduced. The pilot's recorded MAE/RMSE/r and median embedding cosine are quoted context only; the archived embeddings are not loaded, scored or promoted, and no adverse or missing-input control was exercised against a real encoder.","status":"open"},{"artifact_id":"ART-07","id":"BLK-06","linked_gates":["RG-07","RG-08"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"After model/data/runtime/quality gates clear, measure the exact target-device paced workload and complete the Rate profile, then open a separate OFF-by-default versioned provider intake with independent exact-head review